Test whether measurements from good and bad quality images are still in the same distribution
```{r}
# body length, ctene row length, and body width
t.test(PAs ~ quality, data = PA_measurement, val.equal = FALSE)
t.test(PAsscr ~ quality, data = PA_measurement, val.equal = FALSE)
t.test(PAbw ~ quality, data = PA_measurement, val.equal = FALSE)

# lobe and auricle
t.test(PAli ~ quality, data = PA_measurement, val.equal = FALSE)
t.test(PAari ~ quality, data = PA_measurement, val.equal = FALSE)
```

