### clustering
Multidimensional scaling
PCA

#### PA
```{r}
l.PCA <- prcomp(select_if(PA_measurement, is.numeric), scale. = FALSE)
summary(l.PCA)
```

```{r}
fviz_pca_ind(l.PCA, 
             habillage=PA$quality,
             addEllipses=TRUE)
```
GMM
not using k-mean because it also assumes same variance & not overlapping
```{r}
library(mclust)

gmm_PA <- Mclust(PA_numeric)  
summary(gmm_PA)

plot(gmm_PA, what = "classification")  # Cluster assignment
plot(gmm_PA, what = "BIC")             # BIC scores for model selection
```

```{r}
gmm_PA <- Mclust(PA_numeric,G=2) 
# Get the cluster assignments
cluster_assignments <- predict(gmm_PA)$classification

# Visualize the results
plot(PA_numeric, col = cluster_assignments, main = "GMM Clustering Results")
points(gmm_PA$parameters$mean, col = 1:3, pch = 8, cex = 2)
```

